{"id": "114-2-C-071", "year": 114, "session": 2, "subject": "C", "number": 71, "stem": "當掃描條件改變時（沒說明的參數維持不變），對於 SPECT 影像訊雜比（SNR）的影響，下列敘述何者正確？", "options": {"A": "每個角度的掃描時間由 20 秒改成 30 秒，SNR 會上升", "B": "將能窗由±10%改成±20%，SNR 會上升", "C": "將截止頻率（cycle/pixel）由 0.5 改成 0.3 時，SNR 會下降", "D": "將 matrix size 由 128×128 改成 256×256，SNR 會上升"}, "answer": "A", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": false, "figures": [], "source": "sources/114_2/0602_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
